# ===========================================
# Runtime state — written by scanner, should never be committed
# (2026-05-11 cleanup: autonomous retrain failed with [Errno 28] No space
# left on device because disk was 98% full. Root cause: tracked runtime
# state files accumulated 79 dirty entries in git status, masking real
# changes and burning index churn. These files are runtime telemetry,
# not source. Existing-tracked copies stop showing in `git status` via
# `git update-index --skip-worktree <path>` (local-only, not committed).)
# ===========================================
.claude/state.json
.claude/heartbeat.json
.claude/alert_state.json
.claude/last_tx_id.json
.claude/state_drift_log.jsonl
.claude/ralph/memory.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

